    "CommitMsg": "chore(security): FIPS-only KDF, validated subprocess targets, unconditional TLS, drop dead pins\n\n- auth: PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 exclusively — scrypt hashing/verification\n  removed (FIPS 140-3 has no scrypt approval); legacy scrypt$ hashes\n  fail closed, affected accounts reset via scripts/manage_users.py.\n- tools: all 7 subprocess call sites (playbook/case-bundle/skill/\n  git-sync/maintenance/health-check/intel-fetcher) resolve targets\n  through validated_tool_target (in-tree, real file, allowed ext)\n  and validated_arg_list; shell is never True.\n- splunk: SPLUNK_VERIFY_TLS=false / verify_tls=False now raises\n  instead of disabling; tls_settings reports verify-always-true with\n  the refusal as a readiness problem; tests rewritten to pin refusal.\n- pins: deleted all 31 dead python_version \u003c3.10 entries from both\n  requirements files and removed .trivyignore — Trivy reports 0\n  vulns / 0 secrets with no suppressions active.\n\nVerified: 608 pytest passed; semgrep 0 findings; gitleaks clean;\ntrivy exit 0; SBOM + marker gates green.",
    "Author": "soc-platform-bot \u003cbot@soc-platform.local\u003e",
    "Committer": "soc-platform-bot \u003cbot@soc-platform.local\u003e"
  },
